kubeconform v0.6.7 (and v0.8.0) force JSON Schema Draft-4. The catalog
file is valid newer-draft JSON Schema: one property named
additionalProperties (JSONSchemaProps on spec.provider.crd.whitelist.rules)
is the boolean false. Draft-4 requires a schema object there, so
Compile fails and kubeconform reports "could not find schema" after a
successful HTTP 200.

Patched: that boolean false -> {"not": {}}
